      "kind": "page_text",
      "text": "Types of Sampling\n\n Sampling plans are strategies used in quality control to\n decide whether to accept or reject a lot (batch) of items\n based on inspection of a sample. There are several types of\n attribute sampling plans, each with different procedures and\n purposes.\n Single Sampling Plan\nDouble Sampling Plan\n Multiple Sampling Plan\n Sequential Sampling Plan",
