      "kind": "page_text",
      "text": "Multiple Sampling Plan\n\nProcess: Similar to double sampling, but involves several\n  possible samples and decision stages.\n  At each stage, after inspecting the added sample, you\n     decide whether to accept, reject, or continue sampling.\nAdvantages:\n  Tends to minimize the average number of items\n     inspected since decisions are made as soon as possible.\nDisadvantages:\n  Most complex administratively; highest record-keeping\n     and operational requirements.",
